# Dragonfly Swarm's power is the number of noncreature, nonland cards in its controller's graveyard. Bot1 casts two Thought Scours with
# Black Lotus: the first mills Bot2's Mox Pearl and Lightning Bolt (an opponent's graveyard is not counted), the second mills Bot1's own
# Grizzly Bears (a creature card) and Island (a land card), neither counted. With the sacrificed Black Lotus (an artifact) and the two
# Thought Scours counted, the Swarm is 3/3. On turn 3 Bot1 casts Lightning Bolt: the Swarm's power follows the graveyard up to 4.

